        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The table shows the frequency of adults using the internet in one European country from 2006 to 2010. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The table shows the frequency of adults using the internet in one European country from 2006 to 2010. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Internet Use in Europe: 2006&ndash;2010</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLFOdaXQXo81HuxXYt4lD4hSgmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BW3vdiC9rojmuFxGtthlsuICgaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Internet Use in Europe: 2006&ndash;2010 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tần suất sử dụng internet của người lớn ở một quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u từ 2006 đến 2010</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3LtdQTfLo1VDvxozLglWV05gXe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ht3Pdv9iuoNdtyxxMeMl3KjggBd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Internet Use in Europe: 2006&ndash;2010 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tần suất sử dụng Internet của người lớn - ở một quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u - từ 2006 đến 2010.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UCZ5dkxyyoHYDqxGR5tlQCH7gCe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gh1Wd2aduo9cOFxUCjvl9vycg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>nh&oacute;m daily v&agrave; weekly nh&igrave;n chung l&agrave; c&oacute; xu hướng tăng, c&ograve;n nh&oacute;m three times a month v&agrave; never giảm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TPp4d1VyMoRyaTxMAJRlVF0dgvf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>v&agrave;o cuối thời kỳ, hầu hết người lớn ở quốc gia n&agrave;y thuộc nh&oacute;m daily, trong khi đ&oacute; thiểu số l&agrave; những người kh&ocirc;ng sử dụng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDj9dC7csonoDbxU8uNl9dBKgTf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> nh&oacute;m daily v&agrave; weekly</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShCDdHUUfon7VfxmLpIlzLgSgdh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpScdT19Xosdk0xvP4HlCpWfg9f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2006 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m daily ghi nhận 36%, cao hơn gấp đ&ocirc;i con số của người d&ugrave;ng weekly, ở mức 15%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W9jYdKcU3oLMPmxid7JlvEjRgmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m daily </strong><em>(tăng đều đặn qua c&aacute;c năm, đạt 45% v&agrave;o năm 2008, sau đ&oacute; tăng vọt l&ecirc;n 72% v&agrave;o năm 2009 - tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRkGdiLvooRobrxK2jTlJJbigjg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m weekly </strong><em>(tăng l&ecirc;n 29% v&agrave;o năm 2008, sau đ&oacute; giảm xuống c&ograve;n 22% v&agrave;o năm 2009)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HTNgdWhMhoG5iWxFntllaa3YgVd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> nh&oacute;m three times a month v&agrave; never</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R6ytdlI3CoPhsZxZ1J6lfJkfgDd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zm3Tdkpp3o6A7KxEo1QltZIMgDb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2006 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m never ghi nhận 34%, cao hơn gấp đ&ocirc;i con số của người d&ugrave;ng three times a month, ở mức 15%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IlUZdSH8zoUF9vx2n12luT8OgCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m never </strong><em>(giảm xuống 20% v&agrave;o năm 2007 v&agrave; tiếp tục giảm đ&aacute;ng kể xuống chỉ c&ograve;n 1% v&agrave;o năm 2010).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VtWadIHO7oogH6xPPR0lbzdjgFd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m three times a month </strong><em>(giảm từ từ xuống c&ograve;n 5% v&agrave;o năm 2010 - với mức giảm đ&aacute;ng kể nhất xảy ra giữa năm 2007 v&agrave; 2008 - tận 5%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcKgd2ZQhoZ6q3xBXhJl7Hbvg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cj1rd9yiKomFwQxn166lRSuKg8d\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>người sử dụng Internet mỗi ng&agrave;y\", </strong>m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TWegdXoOXofHLMxat0sl2QVygLg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>people who used the Internet on a daily basis</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TCI4dRhe4oPMHVxXTgull4f1gk5\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>people who went online every day</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RxRhdmEFpoqn7exFGXol77mYgIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>daily Internet users</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LnaOdfooxorrXoxjpnXlldCJgZC\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NYWVdsA6QotqU4xGw2TlwZgggIb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>36% of adults <strong>used the internet on a daily basis</strong> in 2006.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 930,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FrU1duaqKom3hkxiQlMlAIwRgSe\">The table illustrates the frequency with which adults accessed the internet in a European country over a five-year period from 2006 to 2010.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16222,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 931,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TydLdpkvyoyC6FxZbXhl8tGzgEf\">Overall, there was a clear upward trend in daily and weekly internet usage throughout the period, while the percentage of people who occasionally (three times a month) and never used the internet declined dramatically. By 2010, the majority of adults were daily internet users, compared to a minority of non-users.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16222,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 932,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HbhWdwFwBo5t9nx2XUWlRwaGgof\">Regarding the more frequent internet users, in 2006, 36% of adults used the internet on a daily basis, which was more than twice the figure for weekly users, at 15%. The daily usage figure then rose consistently year on year, reaching 45% in 2008 before surging to 72% in 2010, representing a doubling of the initial figure. In contrast, the proportion of weekly users, while initially increasing to 29% in 2008, subsequently fell back to 22% by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16222,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 933,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VSsTdsqmGoOVuRxoER1lh8YkgFb\">As for the less frequent internet users, both categories showed declining trends. In 2006, 34% of adults never used the internet, which was more than double the figure for those who used it three times a month, at 15%. The percentage of people who never went online then fell sharply to 20% in 2007 and continued to decrease dramatically to just 1% by 2010. Meanwhile, the three-times-monthly users declined more gradually, from 15% in 2006 to 5% in 2010, with the most significant drop occurring between 2007 and 2008, when the figure fell by 5 percentage points.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16222,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "writing_graph_image": "4f601c06-095a-43e5-9d78-8006e8ee72f9",
